Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.51,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te comparas por debajo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:49.15,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y ves lo peor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:49.30,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de ti
